  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c463aea7-4d2d-529b-bebf-56cce69ae402" activityNameId="afa22af4-6e70-56ee-a966-4bb87cb7b2f0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Use, computer, desktop with LCD monitor, active mode</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Use, computer, desktop with LCD monitor, active mode
The computer desktop use in the active mode includes the share of computer production (CPU, keyboard, mouse, LCD) as well as the energy consumption (use-phase) and the rail and road transport from factory to user. Energy consumption of computer CPUs and LCD monitors (use-phase) vary a lot depending on the computer looked at. Min.-Max. values are listed;
Synonyms: PC; 
UUID: 8ab95a02-54bf-3364-8698-67d1bd2ea925
Describes the use of a desktop computer with a LCD monitor in the active mode. Calculated per 1 hour of computer use. Computer life span assumed to be 4 years, for the LCD monitor 6 years. Active mode 5.5 hours a day (office use), 240 days a year. Swiss supply mix applied for electricity consumption (low voltage).
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: No technology involved, except for the production of the desktop computer (including LCD, keyboard and mouse), which is described in another dataset.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturers, literature and own assumptions. 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: International data suitable for Switzerland.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8ab95a02-54bf-3364-8698-67d1bd2ea925.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
